ision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huowang-q-8b524afb24641cfe8764"]},"ordering_evidence":"huowang-q-8b524afb24641cfe8764","source_order":[41,30,107],"order":7384}],"persons":[{"id":"liuliao-p0022","name":"王连","evidence":["liuliao-q-b6ac46d1e937aa8eba43","dongliu-q-ad31f4dd28bce9fa7905","huowang-q-b8398cee49efe49f1742","huowang-q-931f58b1dac0362c6f9f","huowang-q-5e68cb9d422d8b0832d1","huowang-q-44aa66b8bd75584baf82","huowang-q-6820315b68719093f7f1","huowang-q-2b7b7336f9cdc73ef8ca","huowang-q-40ebd658e7ac201835e1","huowang-q-5cb745eb53925f88a1ac","huowang-q-8b524afb24641cfe8764","huowang-q-d31f418dd718fd014242","huowang-q2-d04494cf17320d81fd3c"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"liuliao-m-c876f6824f782487d3f6","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及王连","evidence":["liuliao-q-b6ac46d1e937aa8eba43"]},{"id":"huowang-m2-role-657a43d20a9e9223d38e","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["huowang-q-d31f418dd718fd014242","huowang-q2-d04494cf17320d81fd3c"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongliu-q-ad31f4dd28bce9fa7905","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-d9f3c081df9acfb0fd2a","layer":"original","quote":"后校尉王连请乂及南阳杜祺、南乡刘幹等并为典曹都尉","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":50},{"id":"huowang-q-2b7b7336f9cdc73ef8ca","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-32c9d11bbe75c96df1dc","layer":"original","quote":"迁蜀郡太守、兴业将军，领盐府如故","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":82,"end":98},{"id":"huowang-q-40ebd658e7ac201835e1","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-06613e51c683d2b88d8d","layer":"original","quote":"建兴元年，拜屯骑校尉〖3〗，领丞相长史〖4〗，封平阳亭侯","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28},{"id":"huowang-q-44aa66b8bd75584baf82","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-32c9d11bbe75c96df1dc","layer":"original","quote":"迁司盐校尉，较盐铁之利，利入甚多，有裨国用","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":47},{"id":"huowang-q-5cb745eb53925f88a1ac","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-06613e51c683d2b88d8d","layer":"original","quote":"时南方诸郡不宾，诸葛亮将自征之。连谏以为：“此不毛之地，疫疠之乡；不宜以一国之望〖5〗，冒险而行。”亮虑诸将才不及己，意欲必往；而连言辄恳至，故停留者久之","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":106},{"id":"huowang-q-5e68cb9d422d8b0832d1","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-32c9d11bbe75c96df1dc","layer":"original","quote":"及成都既平，以连为什邡令〖2〗。转在广都，所居有绩","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25},{"id":"huowang-q-6820315b68719093f7f1","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-32c9d11bbe75c96df1dc","layer":"original","quote":"于是简取良才以为官属，若吕乂、杜祺、刘幹等；终皆至大官，自连所拔也","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":48,"end":81},{"id":"huowang-q-8b524afb24641cfe8764","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-06613e51c683d2b88d8d","layer":"original","quote":"会连卒","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":29,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":107,"end":110},{"id":"huowang-q-931f58b1dac0362c6f9f","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-e13e77047421b23704d8","layer":"original","quote":"先主起事葭萌，进军来南；连闭城不降，先主义之，不强逼也","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":25,"end":52},{"id":"huowang-q-b8398cee49efe49f1742","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-e13e77047421b23704d8","layer":"original","quote":"刘璋时入蜀，为梓潼令","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":11,"end":21},{"id":"huowang-q-d31f418dd718fd014242","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-5008b9b7cd23cd6b1641","layer":"original","quote":"后主践阼，为步兵校尉，代王连领丞相长史","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19},{"id":"huowang-q2-d04494cf17320d81fd3c","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-5008b9b7cd23cd6b1641","layer":"original","quote":"后主践阼，为步兵校尉，代王连领丞相长史。丞相亮南征，朗留统后事。","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32},{"id":"liuliao-q-b6ac46d1e937aa8eba43","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-1299f01ed12fc89c34bb","layer":"original","quote":"后主袭位，徙长水校尉。立本意，自谓才名宜为诸葛亮之贰；而更游散在李严等下，常怀怏怏。后丞相掾李（郃）〔邵〕、蒋琬至，立计曰：“军当远出，卿诸人好谛其事〖5〗：昔先（主）〔帝〕不取汉中，走与吴人争南三郡；卒以三郡与吴人，徒劳役吏士，无益而还。既亡汉中；使夏侯渊、张郃深入于巴，几丧一州。后至汉中；使关侯身死无孑遗〖6〗；上庸覆败，徒失一方。是羽怙恃勇名，作军无法〖7〗，直以意突耳〖8〗；故前后数丧师众也。如向朗、文恭，凡俗之人耳：恭作治中，无纲纪；朗昔奉马良兄弟，谓为‘圣人’，今作长史，素能合道。中郎郭演长，从人者耳，不足与经大事；而作侍中。今弱世也〖9〗，欲任此三人〖10〗，为不然也。王连流俗〖11〗，苟作掊克〖12〗；使百姓疲弊，以致今日。”","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":157,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":325}],"profiles":{"liuliao-p0022":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
